+        "fragment float4 fsMid(V in [[stage_in]], texture2d<float> t [[texture(0)]], texture2d<float> c1 [[texture(1)]], sampler s [[sampler(0)]], constant Crop& c [[buffer(0)]], device const uint* cut [[buffer(1)]]) {\n"
